  "body": "## Changelog\n* 1a134b005f1d5321b56272423e49eadb8474a6a3 Add self package to flake.nix, nix fixes, fmt\n* 09b5b1824ecf4c7c95a6e1b39a599ebaff382bae Merge branch 'main' into dependabot/github_actions/actions/setup-go-7\n* c04cca164ea243ffbbde66e424215264ce536db9 Merge branch 'main' into kai/nixupdates\n* 9e954ae8b63994c94bea9f340e5cbb66ec5657f3 Merge pull request #200 from clawscli/dependabot/github_actions/actions/checkout-7\n* 876177430e480439ebaf4584dc58cce9b30f36de Merge pull request #202 from nick4eva/add-ability-to-paste-search-string-from-clipboard\n* a035f89220344131ec30b71c4c856b4c4da2a416 Merge pull request #203 from KaiSforza/kai/nixupdates\n* 7a0a8eaf1f3538bd63407176b3e4be96012944d4 Merge pull request #204 from clawscli/dependabot/github_actions/actions/setup-go-7\n* 7edd29f45fee4ebdd57f72ee369b026fd89bdef5 ci: bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7\n* a3dab3f5cf3fc656ff8aaa375c80bb846e91e1be ci: bump actions/setup-go from 6 to 7\n* c569b46b1c929f746ebcf1149bddd8702972505f fix(ui): return clipboard paste to command input and keep log scroll\n* 5e97066f476a6c5618090c62425f8ade2ad18590 fix(ui): support clipboard paste in filter and command inputs\n\n"
